Modifications made in this product:
  - Judge model loaded in 4-bit NF4 quantization for ZeroGPU hardware.
  - Fixed thinking-budget presets (Fast, Balanced, Fidelity).
  - Selectable evaluation dimensions.
  - Gradio interface with streamed reasoning and score reporting.
